{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_58","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' ISSUE_COMMENTS.md PR_COMMENTS.md\"","aggregated_output":"Added `MONDO:7770736` for `TSEN2-related neurodevelopmental disorder with or without thrombotic microangiopathy` and committed the ontology change locally in commit `fa8b2e6`.\n\nThis models the requested TSEN2-related neurodevelopmental spectrum term and keeps both `pontocerebellar hypoplasia type 2B` and `TRACK syndrome` as related synonyms. Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\nAdded a new MONDO term, `MONDO:7770736` (`TSEN2-related neurodevelopmental disorder with or without thrombotic microangiopathy`), under neurodevelopmental disorder / Mendelian neurodevelopmental disorder with a TSEN2 gene logical definition using verified `HGNC:28422`.\n\nRationale:\n- The issue request describes a TSEN2-associated neurodevelopmental spectrum that spans the older pontocerebellar hypoplasia literature and the newer TSEN2/TRACK syndrome cases with thrombotic microangiopathy.\n- I modeled this as a broader TSEN2-related neurodevelopmental disorder term rather than as a renal or thrombotic microangiopathy subclass, because the requested label is explicitly `with or without thrombotic microangiopathy`.\n- I preserved the published labels `pontocerebellar hypoplasia type 2B` and `TRACK syndrome` as `RELATED` synonyms rather than exact synonyms, since the requested MONDO term is broader than either label alone.\n\nSources reviewed:\n- Issue-cited TSEN2 / pontocerebellar hypoplasia literature: `PMID:18711368`, `PMID:20952379`, `PMID:23562994`\n- Additional TSEN2 atypical HUS / TRACK literature needed to support the requested disease concept: `PMID:34964109`, `PMID:37338178`\n- Verified the official TSEN2 HGNC identifier via HGNC REST: `HGNC:28422`\n\nValidation performed:\n- Checked the new term into `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo` using `obo-checkin.pl`\n- Ran `make NORM` in `src/ontology/` and replaced `mondo-edit.obo` with the normalized output\n- Ran `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o mondo-edit.TMP.obo`\n- Removed the temporary conversion output afterward\n\nCompleted checklist:\n- [x] Read imported issue context\n- [x] Reviewed cited TSEN2 literature and additional syndrome-defining literature\n- [x] Verified parentage against existing MONDO structure\n- [x] Verified TSEN2 gene identifier\n- [x] Added the new term with definition, synonyms, logical axioms, and issue tracker metadata\n- [x] Normalized and syntax-checked the ontology\n- [x] Committed only the ontology change\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
